{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_05",
  "title": "Winding Path to Victory",
  "storyCode": "DH-5",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d016b9f7808150a3de20e92098faf28bbbb53d51ad71abbf1a10ff7b7b3028a1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What now? LUNG wRATh have hit a government-issued ambush blockade."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In all the frenzy, Ernesto's decided to take up the rear, and the two heroines have caught his key and left to press forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ernesto's combat strength might be as impressive, but with this many enemies, his defeat could only be a matter of time anyway!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But as for the heroines, they've broken out of the entrapment, but ambushes still lie ahead! Can they really get away without a hitch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh? They've opened a door on the street and rushed inside!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This store..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is one of Ernesto's."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So that's their game! Looks like the key Ernesto left them works for sheltering in a shop of his."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But is this truly going to work out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hold on! Director, switch cameras!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, that's the REAL game! From another angle it all makes sense. This store has a back door."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And we can see, there's a passage from that door through to the main street, and it hasn't been discovered by any other team's interference!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is this LUNG wRATh's chance, or is it—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The words are still on D.D.D.'s lips when, there on the screen, the sound of a tremendous explosion comes from Ernesto's arms store."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wh—Wh-Wh-What in the world is going on here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lady Candela, is that an obstacle you installed as well?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If it was, it wouldn't be as basic as blowing up this one single shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This... could it be that another team knew Ernesto had this up his sleeve, and laid a trap?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If so, then we can say LUNG wRATh has been completely and utterly outdone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "LUNG wRATh, is this what buries you?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eyjafjalla",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_190_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow... Miss Ch'en and Miss Lin will be okay, won't they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Relax, they've both been around the block. A little explosion like that's not gonna get them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That said... this competition's no stranger to dirty play, but this one's a little too targeted."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wonder if Ch'en's got beef with someone here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ambush A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_194",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Grrr... what the hell's with this guy? I can't even hit him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uh... I think that's the way Miss Ch'en's bunch went."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go take a look and see."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hui-chieh, are you dead?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*cough*, *cough*. Like that would kill me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're alive. Good. Your bike?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perfectly fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It seems our opposition didn't want us dead and buried either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As luck would have it, the exit is blocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, good for luck."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your view?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We find a way out. What else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What I'm asking is who did it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like our intuition was on the mark."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right. Ernesto couldn't hold it in, I'm guessing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But don't you think it's odd? If I were him, this isn't how I'd do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Only one at the end of his rope would use such self-destructive means."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe, it wasn't actually him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Impossible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe, he wants us to think he's desperate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lin Yühsia raises her eyebrows, and leaves it be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right. Have you told Lady Candela about the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How did she respond?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You won't do anything... will you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's right, my girl. You're a smart one. You should be able to figure it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If I sent someone to inspect the bombs now, wouldn't that just be telling the mastermind I've noticed their schemes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No matter, Ch'en. You and Lin have done very well already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To be frank, at the start I had no expectations you'd find anything at all, hahaha."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And you don't seem to care?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course, my girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And you needn't worry about this too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've seen you and Lin put on a very good show in the championship. Why not forget all this, and try your very hardest for number one? You'll put a smile on Wei Yenwu's face too, hahaha."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We'll take it into consideration."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can probably imagine it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now, how do we get out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I heard a certain Special Inspection Unit Chief could dice apart a whole building in her rage. Mind showing me first-hand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not every building's so sliceable. This one's clearly built from exceptionally sturdy stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can you use your sand ability to transport things?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not my dad. A blockage of this level, with my ability, would need some time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then I'll have a go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No need. I have another method."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can you guess what this is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...A bomb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you remember the bomb from the first round?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There was no way Lady Candela could conduct a wide search, but I had a few of the boys here dress up as thieves and enter the neighborhood to steal as many as they could."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thieves?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thieves. So long as they gave the guards a bribe, and didn't make too much noise inside, no one would care about them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "........"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lin Yühsia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You might be unalike, but I have always deeply respected you and Mr. Lin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The slums couldn't go on without you, I know that much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't let me catch you enjoying yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hui-chieh... nobody would ever assign themselves blame of their own accord."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Out of the way. I'm going to set the bomb."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
